# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Read-only DLPack views of a simulation on a GPU (D[python-dlpack]),
# scenario ctypes of Inputs/python_dlpack.py: a reader of the capsule in
# ctypes and the CUDA driver API as the consumer.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_dlpack.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU ctypes | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Double: positions float64, forces float64 on device 0, read by the driver on a stream of its own, released once without the GIL
# CHECK: Mixed: positions float64, forces float64 on device 0, read by the driver on a stream of its own, released once without the GIL
# CHECK: Mixed, not deterministic: positions float64, forces float32 on device 0, read by the driver on a stream of its own, released once without the GIL
# CHECK: a capsule not taken releases once; a tensor outlives its simulation while another runs
# CHECK: dlpack ctypes passed
